        "s": "Q18. For three numbers a, b, c forming an AP: a+b+c=12 and a\u00b2+b\u00b2+c\u00b2=56. Then the numbers are:\n(A) 2, 4, 6 (B) 3, 4, 5 (C) 1, 4, 7 (D) 2, 5, 8\nAnswer: (C) 1, 4, 7 [b=4; a+c=8, a\u00b2+c\u00b2=56\u221216=40; (a+c)\u00b2\u22122ac=40\u219264\u22122ac=40\u2192ac=12; but wait: a+c=8, ac=12; t\u00b2\u22128t+12=0\u2192t=2 or 6; so (2,4,6)]\nCorrection: (A) 2, 4, 6; verify: sum=12\u2713; sum of squares=4+16+36=56\u2713",
