        "s": "Q41. If x = 1+a+a\u00b2+\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 (|a|<1) and y = 1+b+b\u00b2+\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 (|b|<1), then 1+ab+a\u00b2b\u00b2+\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 =:\n(A) xy/(x+y\u22121) (B) (x+y)/(xy) (C) xy/(xy\u2212x\u2212y+1) (D) Both A and C\nAnswer: (D) Both A and C [x=1/(1-a), y=1/(1-b); a=1-1/x, b=1-1/y; 1/(1-ab) = xy/(xy-(x-1)(y-1)) = xy/(xy-xy+x+y-1) = xy/(x+y-1)]",
