        "s": "Q19. The image of circle C\u2081 in a line is a circle C\u2082. Then:\n(A) C\u2081 and C\u2082 have the same radius (B) Area(C\u2081)=Area(C\u2082) (C) Both (D) Neither\nAnswer: (C) Both [Reflection preserves all distances \u2192 same radius and area]",
