        "a": 2,
        "s": "Q1. The eccentricity of the ellipse 9x\u00b2+5y\u00b2=45 is:\n(A) 1/3 (B) 2/3 (C) \u221a(4/9)=2/3 (D) 1/\u221a5\nAnswer: (C) 2/3 [x\u00b2/5+y\u00b2/9=1; a\u00b2=9,b\u00b2=5; e=\u221a(1-5/9)=\u221a(4/9)=2/3]",
        "source": "Ellipse imported bank Q1"
