        "s": "Q9. Tangent to x\u00b2/4+y\u00b2/3=1 at (1,3/2) is:\n(A) x/4+y/2=1 (B) x+2y=4 (C) x/2+y=... T: xx\u2081/a\u00b2+yy\u2081/b\u00b2=1; x\u00b71/4+y\u00b7(3/2)/3=1; x/4+y/2=1; multiply: x+2y=4\nAnswer: (B) x+2y=4",
