        "q": "If a = \u00ee+\u0135+k\u0302 and b = \u00ee-\u0135+k\u0302, find a vector c such that a\u00d7c = b and a\u00b7c = 3:\na\u00d7c = b = \u00ee-\u0135+k\u0302; a\u00b7c = 3\nIf c = x\u00ee+y\u0135+zk\u0302:\na\u00b7c = x+y+z=3\na\u00d7c = \u0135(z-x)+k\u0302(-y-x)+\u00ee(y-z)... let me compute: \u00ee(z-y)... hmm:\na\u00d7c = |\u00ee \u0135 k\u0302|\n |1 1 1|\n |x y z|\n= \u00ee(z-y)-\u0135(z-x)+k\u0302(y-x)=\u00ee-\u0135+k\u0302\nz-y=1, z-x=1, y-x=1; so x=y-1, z=x+1=y; x+y+z=y-1+y+y=3y-1=3\u2192y=4/3; x=1/3; z=4/3;\nc=(1/3)\u00ee+(4/3)\u0135+(4/3)k\u0302... not clean. Standard",
