        "s": "Q34. lim(n\u2192\u221e) \u220f(k=1 to n)(1+k/n)^(1/n) =\n(A) 4/e (B) e/4 (C) e (D) 4\nAnswer: (A) 4/e [ln of product = (1/n)\u2211ln(1+k/n)\u2192\u222b\u2080\u00b9ln(1+x)dx=[x ln(1+x)\u2212x+ln(1+x)]\u2080\u00b9=2ln2\u22121; e^(2ln2\u22121)=4/e]",
        "source": "Definite Integration imported bank Q34"
