        "a": 0,
        "s": "Q1. Area bounded by y = x\u00b2 and y = x is:\n(A) 1/6 (B) 1/3 (C) 1/2 (D) 1\nAnswer: (A) 1/6 [Intersect at 0,1; \u222b\u2080\u00b9(x\u2212x\u00b2)dx=[x\u00b2/2\u2212x\u00b3/3]\u2080\u00b9=1/2\u22121/3=1/6]",
        "source": "Area Under Curves imported bank Q1"
